OL,3,GNEWSAUber driver fatally ran over
OL,4,Apassenger in 'panic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Uber driver was "panicking and
OL,7,Ffrightened" when he fatally ran over a
OL,8,Fpassenger who vomited in his car, a
OL,9,Fmurder trial heard.
OL,11,FHayadulla Turkmani, 53, said he
OL,12,Fmistakenly struck 28-year-old Michael
OL,13,FAshton while trying to "escape" him
OL,14,Fafter a heated exchange in September
OL,15,F2025.
OL,17,FThe council worker hit his head on the
OL,18,Ffloor following the collision, outside
OL,19,Fhis house in Langdon Hills, Essex, and
OL,20,Fdied from his injuries eight days
OL,21,Flater.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
